<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the latter part of day, evening</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρθρος</span>, freq. joined with
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείλη</span> (q. v.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέχρι δείλης ὀψίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.167
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ δείλην ὀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.26
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείλης ὀ.</span>
			<i>late</i> in the evening, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				57.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψίας</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				528.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψιος</span>.</div>
